
>> animal := Objekt neu. 
 
 animal wenn: ['name:'] tun: { :n
eigen name := n.
}. 


animal name: ['Diva']. 
 
animal wenn: ['name'] tun: { <- name.
}.

>> cat := animal neu.
 
 cat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 cat wenn: ['name'] tun: { <- ['your royal highness ']
+ (selbst name).
}.

Ausgabe schreiben: cat name.
